    <script type="application/ld+json">
      {"@context":"http://schema.org","@graph":[{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"CROATIAN POWER EXCHANGE Ltd. (CROPEX)","url":"https://hr.linkedin.com/company/croatian-power-exchange-ltd."},"datePublished":"2026-07-27T11:15:29.550Z","headline":"Mlađi stručnjak za vođenje tržišta (m/ž)","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":12},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/croatian-power-exchange-ltd%2E_cropex-tra%C5%BEi-novog-%C4%8Dlanaicu-tima-u-odjelu-activity-7487465684499718146-xWo1","text":"🚀 CROPEX traži novog člana/icu tima u Odjelu za vođenja tržišta električne energije! 👨‍💼👩‍💼\n \n📊 Odgovornosti uključuju operativno vođenje tržišta, nadzor trgovanja, komunikaciju s članovima burze i sudjelovanje na EU projektima.\n \n🎓 Znanja i kvalifikacije:\n \n·      VSS tehničkog ili prirodnog smjera \n·      Odlično znanje engleskog jezika u govoru i pismu\n·      Odlično poznavanje MS Office alata\n·      Osnovno razumijevanje informacijskih sustava i automatizacije procesa (prednost)\n·      Osnovno znanje korištenja programskih jezika i API sučelja (prednost)\n·      Iskustvo u energetskom sektoru ili sličnim područjima (prednost)\n·      Točnost, sistematičnost i odgovornost u obavljanju zadataka\n·      Izražene komunikacijske vještine i sklonost timskom radu\n \n💼 Pošaljite svoj životopis na info@cropex.hr i postanite dio našeg tima!\n\nPrijava do: 6.8.2026.","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/croatian-power-exchange-ltd%2E_cropex-tra%C5%BEi-novog-%C4%8Dlanaicu-tima-u-odjelu-activity-7487465684499718146-xWo1"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"CROATIAN POWER EXCHANGE Ltd. (CROPEX)","url":"https://hr.linkedin.com/company/croatian-power-exchange-ltd."},"datePublished":"2026-07-06T11:28:37.410Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":17},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/croatian-power-exchange-ltd%2E_energytrading-cropex-intradaymarket-activity-7479858843825598464-Zu0d","text":"CROPEX achieved a new monthly record on the Intraday continuous market.💥\nIn June, the highest monthly traded volume to date was recorded, reaching 327.879,7 MWh.💡\nThis milestone confirms the growing importance of the Intraday market and the continued increase in trading activity among market participants.✨\n\n#EnergyTrading #CROPEX #IntradayMarket #MarketUpdate","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/croatian-power-exchange-ltd%2E_energytrading-cropex-intradaymarket-activity-7479858843825598464-Zu0d"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"CROATIAN POWER EXCHANGE Ltd. (CROPEX)","url":"https://hr.linkedin.com/company/croatian-power-exchange-ltd."},"datePublished":"2026-06-10T16:08:15.200Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":83},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/croatian-power-exchange-ltd%2E_etcsee2026-cropex-activity-7470507130492719104-Ml4y","text":"We are pleased to be present today and tomorrow at ETCSEE - Energy Trading Central & South Eastern Europe 2026 in Budapest.\n \nAfter the first day, we already carry very positive impressions, with exchanges of experience and discussions on future partnerships with energy trading professionals from across the region.\n \nWe’re here together with our CROPEX colleagues Siniša Piplica, Ivana Jurčević, Marko Kelava and Nina Porc who will be happy to welcome you at our booth.\n \n#ETCSEE2026 #CROPEX","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/croatian-power-exchange-ltd%2E_etcsee2026-cropex-activity-7470507130492719104-Ml4y"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"CROATIAN POWER EXCHANGE Ltd. (CROPEX)","url":"https://hr.linkedin.com/company/croatian-power-exchange-ltd."},"datePublished":"2026-06-02T10:12:29.378Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":8},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/croatian-power-exchange-ltd%2E_etcsee-2026-is-almost-here-in-just-a-few-activity-7467518496692850688-M4aK","text":"⚡ ETCSEE 2026 is almost here!\nIn just a few days, the energy trading community will meet in Budapest for one of the key regional events dedicated to power and gas markets in Central and South Eastern Europe.\n\n📍 The CROPEX will be there on 10–11 June, where we will also be present with our own stand.\nWe’re looking forward to meeting partners and colleagues, exchanging views on market developments, and connecting with the wider energy community.\n\nSee you in Budapest! ⚡","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/croatian-power-exchange-ltd%2E_etcsee-2026-is-almost-here-in-just-a-few-activity-7467518496692850688-M4aK"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"CROATIAN POWER EXCHANGE Ltd. (CROPEX)","url":"https://hr.linkedin.com/company/croatian-power-exchange-ltd."},"datePublished":"2026-05-27T12:12:26.523Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":42},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/croatian-power-exchange-ltd%2E_kako-zapravo-nastaje-cijena-elektri%C4%8Dne-activity-7465374356546920448-E0UE","text":"⚡ Kako zapravo nastaje cijena električne energije?\nPridružite nam se na Business Skills Workshopu gdje će o funkcioniranju tržišta električne energije, obnovljivim izvorima i budućnosti energetike govoriti Siniša Piplica, direktor CROPEX-a.\n📅 29. 5. 2026. u 16:00\n 📍 Dv. M5 (Martinovka)","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/croatian-power-exchange-ltd%2E_kako-zapravo-nastaje-cijena-elektri%C4%8Dne-activity-7465374356546920448-E0UE"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"CROATIAN POWER EXCHANGE Ltd. (CROPEX)","url":"https://hr.linkedin.com/company/croatian-power-exchange-ltd."},"datePublished":"2026-05-26T11:59:45.685Z","headline":"Mlađi stručnjak za vođenje tržišta (m/ž)","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":27},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/croatian-power-exchange-ltd%2E_cropex-tra%C5%BEi-novog-%C4%8Dlanaicu-tima-u-odjelu-activity-7465008777470312448-JabR","text":"🚀 CROPEX traži novog člana/icu tima u Odjelu za vođenja tržišta električne energije! 👨‍💼👩‍💼\n \n📊 Odgovornosti uključuju operativno vođenje tržišta, nadzor trgovanja, komunikaciju s članovima burze i sudjelovanje na EU projektima.\n \n🎓 Znanja i kvalifikacije:\n \n·      VSS tehničkog ili prirodnog smjera \n·      Odlično znanje engleskog jezika u govoru i pismu\n·      Odlično poznavanje MS Office alata\n·      Osnovno razumijevanje informacijskih sustava i automatizacije procesa (prednost)\n·      Osnovno znanje korištenja programskih jezika i API sučelja (prednost)\n·      Iskustvo u energetskom sektoru ili sličnim područjima (prednost)\n·      Točnost, sistematičnost i odgovornost u obavljanju zadataka\n·      Izražene komunikacijske vještine i sklonost timskom radu\n \n💼 Pošaljite svoj životopis na info@cropex.hr i postanite dio našeg tima!\n\nPrijava do: 07. 06. 2026.\n\nhttps://lnkd.in/dxYEFG9y","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/croatian-power-exchange-ltd%2E_cropex-tra%C5%BEi-novog-%C4%8Dlanaicu-tima-u-odjelu-activity-7465008777470312448-JabR"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"CROATIAN POWER EXCHANGE Ltd. (CROPEX)","url":"https://hr.linkedin.com/company/croatian-power-exchange-ltd."},"datePublished":"2026-05-21T09:53:48.265Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":51},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/croatian-power-exchange-ltd%2E_cropex-je-sudjelovao-na-okruglom-stolu-formiranje-activity-7463165140142628865-puyR","text":"CROPEX je sudjelovao na okruglom stolu „Formiranje burze električne energije u Bosni i Hercegovini“, održanom 19. svibnja 2026. na Elektrotehničkom fakultetu Univerziteta u Sarajevu u organizaciji BH K CIGRE.\n\nKroz predstavljanje iskustava CROATIAN POWER EXCHANGE Ltd. (CROPEX) u razvoju i integraciji tržišta električne energije, Siniša Piplica je istaknuo važnost transparentnog, konkurentnog i regionalno povezanog tržišta te izrazio podršku Bosni i Hercegovini u uspostavi burze električne energije i daljnjem razvoju tržišta električne energije u BiH.\n\nVjerujemo kako je regionalna suradnja jedan od ključnih preduvjeta uspješne energetske tranzicije i učinkovitog funkcioniranja tržišta električne energije u cijeloj Europi.\n\nFOTO BH K CIGRE","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/croatian-power-exchange-ltd%2E_cropex-je-sudjelovao-na-okruglom-stolu-formiranje-activity-7463165140142628865-puyR"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"CROATIAN POWER EXCHANGE Ltd. (CROPEX)","url":"https://hr.linkedin.com/company/croatian-power-exchange-ltd."},"datePublished":"2026-05-15T12:29:46.242Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":147},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/croatian-power-exchange-ltd%2E_we-are-pleased-to-share-that-sini%C5%A1a-piplica-activity-7461030063011135488-1s2Z","text":"We are pleased to share that Siniša Piplica has been appointed as the new CEO of CROPEX.\n\nWith many years of experience in the energy industry and strong expertise in electricity market operations, Siniša will lead CROPEX in its next phase of growth and regional cooperation.\n\nWe look forward to continuing the development of transparent, efficient and integrated electricity markets together with our partners across Europe.\n\nCongratulations to Siniša Piplica on this new responsibility and best wishes for a successful journey ahead!","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/croatian-power-exchange-ltd%2E_we-are-pleased-to-share-that-sini%C5%A1a-piplica-activity-7461030063011135488-1s2Z"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"CROATIAN POWER EXCHANGE Ltd. (CROPEX)","url":"https://hr.linkedin.com/company/croatian-power-exchange-ltd."},"datePublished":"2026-04-07T11:51:45.157Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":1},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/croatian-power-exchange-ltd%2E_cropex-iso27001-informationsecurity-activity-7447249756608757760-1uod","text":"CROPEX has successfully achieved ISO/IEC 27001:2022 certification 🔐🎉\nThis milestone confirms our strong commitment to information security 🔒, data protection 🛡️, and business continuity in an increasingly digital world 💻\nWe continue to strengthen our security practices and build trust with our partners and market participants 🤝✨\n#CROPEX #ISO27001 #InformationSecurity #CyberSecurity #Trust #Compliance #DataProtection","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/croatian-power-exchange-ltd%2E_cropex-iso27001-informationsecurity-activity-7447249756608757760-1uod"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"CROATIAN POWER EXCHANGE Ltd. (CROPEX)","url":"https://hr.linkedin.com/company/croatian-power-exchange-ltd."},"datePublished":"2026-03-30T09:44:04.436Z","headline":"Mlađi stručnjak za vođenje tržišta (m/ž)","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":14},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/croatian-power-exchange-ltd%2E_cropex-tra%C5%BEi-novog-%C4%8Dlanaicu-tima-u-odjelu-activity-7444318522245242880-4o-I","text":"🚀 CROPEX traži novog člana/icu tima u Odjelu za vođenja tržišta električne energije! 👨‍💼👩‍💼\n\n📊 Odgovornosti uključuju operativno vođenje tržišta, nadzor trgovanja, komunikaciju s članovima burze i sudjelovanje na EU projektima.\n\n🎓 Znanja i kvalifikacije:\n\n·        VSS elektrotehničkog smjera \n·        Odlično znanje engleskog jezika u govoru i pismu\n·        Odlično poznavanje MS Office alata\n·        Osnovno znanje korištenja barem jednog programskog jezika i API sučelja (prednost)\n·        Iskustvo u energetskom sektoru ili sličnim područjima (prednost)\n·        Točnost, sistematičnost i odgovornost u obavljanju zadataka\n·        Izražene komunikacijske vještine i sklonost timskom radu\n\n💼 Pošaljite svoj životopis i motivacijsko pismo na info@cropex.hr i postanite dio našeg tima!\n\nPrijava do: 09. 04. 2026.","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/croatian-power-exchange-ltd%2E_cropex-tra%C5%BEi-novog-%C4%8Dlanaicu-tima-u-odjelu-activity-7444318522245242880-4o-I"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"CROATIAN POWER EXCHANGE Ltd. (CROPEX)","url":"https://hr.linkedin.com/company/croatian-power-exchange-ltd.","address":{"type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"Slavonska avenija 6a","addressLocality":"Zagreb","postalCode":"10000","addressCountry":"HR"},"description":"CROATIAN POWER EXCHANGE Ltd. is a company established to provide a central location for trading electricity to their market participants in a safe, reliable and transparent way.\n\nCROATIAN POWER EXCHANGE Ltd. acts as Central Counter Party between sellers and buyers of electricity and takes the risks of buying and selling electricity for all day-ahead and intraday trades concluded on the trading platform.","numberOfEmployees":{"value":13,"@type":"QuantitativeValue"},"logo":{"contentUrl":"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C560BAQHeTi0R7-BgAA/company-logo_200_200/company-logo_200_200/0/1631359072883?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=I3zjvJzRm1ID0HOOavulJHMNBPPXY5ydRIaCpq2aHMs","description":"CROATIAN POWER EXCHANGE Ltd. (CROPEX)","@type":"ImageObject"},"sameAs":"http://www.cropex.hr/en/"}]}
