          <p class="break-words text-color-text" data-test-id="about-us__description">
              CROATIAN POWER EXCHANGE Ltd. is a company established to provide a central location for trading electricity to their market participants in a safe, reliable and transparent way.

CROATIAN POWER EXCHANGE Ltd. acts as Central Counter Party between sellers and buyers of electricity and takes the risks of buying and selling electricity for all day-ahead and intraday trades concluded on the trading platform.
