    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">We are pleased to be present today and tomorrow at <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/etcsee-energy-trading?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>ETCSEE - Energy Trading Central &amp; South Eastern Europe</a> 2026 in Budapest.
 
After the first day, we already carry very positive impressions, with exchanges of experience and discussions on future partnerships with energy trading professionals from across the region.
 
We’re here together with our CROPEX colleagues <a class="link" href="https://hr.linkedin.com/in/sini%C5%A1a-piplica-77757187?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Siniša Piplica</a>, <a class="link" href="https://hr.linkedin.com/in/ivana-jur%C4%8Devi%C4%87-804b81229?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Ivana Jurčević</a>, <a class="link" href="https://hr.linkedin.com/in/marko-kelava-b30abb12b?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Marko Kelava</a> and <a class="link" href="https://hr.linkedin.com/in/np246?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Nina Porc</a> who will be happy to welcome you at our booth.
 
<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fetcsee2026&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#ETCSEE2026</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fcropex&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#CROPEX</a></p>
