    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">We are pleased to share that <a class="link" href="https://hr.linkedin.com/in/sini%C5%A1a-piplica-77757187?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Siniša Piplica</a> has been appointed as the new CEO of CROPEX.

With many years of experience in the energy industry and strong expertise in electricity market operations, Siniša will lead CROPEX in its next phase of growth and regional cooperation.

We look forward to continuing the development of transparent, efficient and integrated electricity markets together with our partners across Europe.

Congratulations to <a class="link" href="https://hr.linkedin.com/in/sini%C5%A1a-piplica-77757187?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Siniša Piplica</a> on this new responsibility and best wishes for a successful journey ahead!</p>
